    sa: ["What is integrity according to Scripture?", ["whole", "honest", "blameless", "consistent", "speech", "conduct"], "A good answer says integrity is moral wholeness in which public and private life match, with truthful speech and upright conduct, walking blamelessly before God, not sinless perfection."],
