    activity: "Read Genesis 3:1-13 and list the steps from doubt to hiding to blaming. Compare with Acts 5:1-11. Discuss how fear, pride and greed motivate lies today. Role-play truth-telling in a difficult situation. Pray for courage to be honest.",
